   "created_at": "2026-04-13T17:19:32.97497+00:00",
   "deletion_locked": false,
   "description": "Article quality labeling system prompt",
   "enabled": true,
   "exclude_agents": [],
   "id": 112,
   "is_global": false,
   "name": "Portfolio Article Quality Labeling System",
   "owner_agent_id": null,
   "prompt_type": "standard",
   "slug": "portfolio-article-quality-labeling-system",
   "updated_at": "2026-04-13T17:19:32.97497+00:00"
  },
  {
   "boot_eligible": false,
   "content": "Review each article row.\nRows use format: symbol|headline|summary.\nFor each row, decide if article is useful for stock investors.\n\nUseful:\n- specific numbers\n- regulatory filings\n- material events\n- analyst actions with targets\n- objective data\n\nNot useful:\n- clickbait\n- listicles\n- vague speculation\n- opinion without data\n- generic commentary\n- marketing\n\nReturn JSON array only.\nSchema:\n[\n  {{\n    \"symbol\": \"AAPL\",\n    \"headline\": \"first 60 chars\",\n    \"is_useful\": true,\n    \"reasons\": [\"specific_data\"],\n    \"confidence\": \"high|medium|low\",\n    \"explanation\": \"brief\"\n  }}\n]\n\nReason codes:\n- specific_data\n- regulatory_filing\n- material_event\n- analyst_action\n- clickbait\n- listicle\n- too_vague\n- opinion_fluff\n- generic_commentary\n- marketing\n- duplicate\n\nRows:\n{article_rows}\n",
